# (docs/library/) is committed: README.md, "Community scenarios".
/library/

# Scenario dumps from dump-scen.sh, cached by test/legacyImport.test.ts
tools/cppharness/scendumps/

# Ghidra project for EXILE3.EXE (tools/e3convert/ghidra/README.md) — derived
